; AurumHydra - AurumHydra_5x_month_FTMO.set with the risk layer on (step 6, owner 2026-10-22). Hydra is the capped side
; bet. The plan's brakes as in tools/book_sim.py's risk layer: half size from 10% under the equity peak, quarter
; size from 20%; account vol target 20% (at most 2x); day-loss guard 5%. Untested with the goal sizing: run it in the
; tester beside the plain preset before any demo uses it. Inputs not listed keep the EA's defaults.
